## Part 5: Monitoring the Learning System

### 5.1 Weekly Learning Report

Automatically sent every Monday:

```jsx
// scripts/weekly-learning-report.js

const report = async () => {
  const insights = await analyzeLearningData();
  
  return {
    period: 'Last 7 days',
    total_automations: insights.automation_count,
    total_executions: insights.execution_count,
    average_success_rate: insights.avg_success_rate,
    
    // Learning outcomes
    performance_improvements: insights.improving_workflows,
    performance_regressions: insights.degrading_workflows,
    new_error_patterns: insights.new_error_types,
    
    // Actionable recommendations
    recommended_optimizations: insights.optimization_recommendations,
    high_priority_alerts: insights.critical_anomalies
  };
};
```

