## Summary: Continuous Learning Checklist

### ✅ Every Workflow Must:

- [ ]  Extend `LearnableWorkflow` base class
- [ ]  Emit metrics via `newrelic.recordCustomEvent()`
- [ ]  Track execution duration and success/failure
- [ ]  Record error types and patterns
- [ ]  Implement `getLearningInsights()` method
- [ ]  Support anomaly detection hooks

### ✅ Every Deployment Must:

- [ ]  Pass observability quality gates in CI/CD
- [ ]  Verify metrics flow to New Relic
- [ ]  Confirm error tracking is active
- [ ]  Validate anomaly detection is running
- [ ]  Generate learning insights report

### ✅ Every Week Must:

- [ ]  Generate learning insights report
- [ ]  Review performance trends
- [ ]  Detect new error patterns
- [ ]  Recommend optimizations
- [ ]  Update automation strategies based on data

---

**The Result**: A system that doesn't just run automations—it learns from every execution, identifies problems before they become critical, and continuously improves itself.
